From 47115b034bc27aa19a12071cb54711e3a3bf78b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TYM Tsai <tymtsai@google.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 18:49:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix TagService access control without AIDL changes

Track dispatched caller UID on tag discovery and validate calling UID
server-side in TagService binder methods. This prevents background apps
holding android.permission.NFC from making raw INfcTag Binder calls to
hijack active NFC tag sessions, without requiring any AIDL interface
modifications. Add regression unit test verification.

Bug: 522373649
Test: atest NfcNciUnitTests:com.android.nfc.NfcServiceTest
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX

TAG=agy
CONV=e3ba36f0-888b-48d0-9e8a-4bb48afa6f0f

Change-Id: I9c24261c2ae81f93083fa628f19462549e8abefb
